==============
BUILDING KISSFFT
==============

Note: this build procedure is no longer needed.

mkdir $path_to_local

cd kissfft
mkdir build
cd build
cmake .. -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$path_to_local
cmake --build .
cmake --install .

==============
FFT INFO
==============

Search "what is an efficient way for software to determine audio volume in the low, mid, and high frequency bands"

KISSFFT REPO - https://github.com/mborgerding/kissfft

Volume Calculation: 
  To find the volume (RMS) for a band, you sum the squares of the FFT magnitudes
  within that band's range, then take the square root of the sum.

                                 sampling freq
freq_resolution (aka deltaf) = -------------------------
                                number of samples


                                 sampling freq
freq_resolution (aka deltaf) = -------------------------
                                 intvl(secs* * sample freq

freq_resolution =   1 / intvl_secs








